    <h1>About Anikawa</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Anikawa</strong> is an anime discovery platform created to help fans
      explore anime, organize their viewing experience, and access content through
      official sources whenever available.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our goal is to provide a clean, user-friendly experience that makes it
      easier for anime fans to discover series, maintain personalized
      watchlists, track viewing history, and enjoy a modern interface inspired
      by the features audiences appreciate most.
    </p>
    <h2>What Anikawa Offers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Anime discovery and browsing features</li>
      <li>Personalized watchlists for registered users</li>
      <li>Viewing history to help users continue where they left off</li>
      <li>Profile customization options</li>
      <li>Embedded content from official third-party sources</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Content Sources</h2>
    <p>
      To enhance the user experience, Anikawa utilizes trusted third-party
      services for certain types of content.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Anime images and related metadata may be displayed using data provided
        through <a
          href="https://www.themoviedb.org"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener
noreferrer">TMDB</a
        >.
      </li>
      <li>
        Certain video content is embedded directly from official YouTube sources
        using YouTube's official embedding functionality.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Important Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Anikawa does not host, upload, download, store, or modify copyrighted
      video content. Embedded videos remain hosted on their respective platforms
      and are subject to the terms, policies, and availability established by
      those platforms and content owners.
    </p>
    <p>
      Anikawa is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially
      connected with TMDB, YouTube, AniOneAsia, or any anime production
      companies, distributors, licensors, or rights holders.
    </p>
    <p>
      This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
    </p>
